        "intent_committed_at",
        "plan_dependency_digest"
      ],
      "$comment": "NOT IMPLEMENTED. H=SHA256 of UTF8 canonical JSON(sort_keys=True, ensure_ascii=False, separators=(',', ':'), allow_nan=False). action_digest=H(complete Action). plan_dependency_digest=H({plan_dependencies_digest:H({graph,precheck,targetcheck,snapshot,policy,execution_mode,session_mode,required_capabilities}),source_ref,target_session_id,comparator_version:'a02-facts-1',prepared_before_sha256}). journal_head_hash is the transaction predecessor hash, not a self-inclusive head. Only a current-library actual durable local transaction gives a WriteIntent qualification."
    },
